Z||000015||Philphine||09-03-2001||01:11 AM||||i hate mine. i was just thinking about posting about it. i just got a 4 speed '86 gt friday (8/31) and it shifts great. so dose an '84 i have. the izuzu has never felt very good to me. particularly the clutch action. i have to act like i'm trying to push the pedal through the floor to get a decent shift. thats after i work on it or i have it worked on (by a pretty reputable shop). i've gotten to the point hat if i really do a swap in my '87 coupe i may look for an economy '84 transaxle to go with it.<P>------------------<BR>Phil T.<P>you can't win. you can't break even and you can't get out of the game.||||reg||1
